    %% Architecture Connections
    Users -->|User requests| AzureFrontDoor
    AzureFrontDoor -->|HTTPS routing for Finnair| AzureApplicationGatewayFinnair
    AzureFrontDoor -->|HTTPS routing for KLM| AzureApplicationGatewayKLM
    AzureApplicationGatewayFinnair -->|Backend routing for Finnair| AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal
    AzureApplicationGatewayKLM -->|Backend routing for KLM| AzureAppServiceKLMPortal
    AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal -->|Data queries for Finnair| AzurePostgreSQL
    AzureAppServiceKLMPortal -->|Data queries for KLM| AzurePostgreSQL
    AzureFunctionsSharedBackend -->|Cache access| AzureRedisCache
    AzureFunctionsSharedBackend -->|Secrets retrieval| AzureKeyVaultShared
    AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal -->|Telemetry for Finnair| AzureApplicationInsights
    AzureAppServiceKLMPortal -->|Telemetry for KLM| AzureApplicationInsights
    AzureAPIManagement -->|API gateway routing| AzureFunctionsSharedBackend
    AzureFrontDoor -->|Secrets & certificate management| AzureKeyVaultSecurity
    AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal -->|Telemetry & diagnostics| AzureMonitor
    AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal -->|Telemetry & diagnostics| AzureLogAnalyticsWorkspace
    AzureFrontDoor -->|Security monitoring| MicrosoftDefenderforCloud
    AzureFirewallPremium -->|Network security filtering| AzureFunctionsSharedBackend
    AzureFrontDoor -->|Content delivery| AzureDDoSProtection
    AzureFrontDoor -->|Security monitoring| MicrosoftSentinel
    AzureFunctionsSharedBackend -->|Database queries| AzurePostgreSQL
    AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal -->|Caching for Finnair portal| AzureCacheforRedis
    AzureAppServiceKLMPortal -->|Caching for KLM portal| AzureCacheforRedis

